        🔒 Code <strong>DIWALI20</strong> automatically applies at checkout
      </p>
      <a href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" id="HMCartViewBagBtn" class="hm-cart-btn hm-cart-btn--secondary">
        View Shopping Bag
